"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All I know is that the mansion is cursed,⟪k:2⟫and that it has brought misfortune upon "
"its residents..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tout ce que je sais, c’est que le manoir est maudit,⟪k:2⟫et qu’il a apporté le malheur "
